 <h4 tabindex="-1" id="Client" data-kind="type" class="Documentation-typeHeader">
 <span>type <a class="Documentation-source" href="https://github.com/gogama/httpx/blob/v1.1.5/client.go#L91">Client</a> <a class="Documentation-idLink" href="#Client" title="Go to Client" aria-label="Go to Client">¶</a></span>
