 TimeoutPolicy <a href="/github.com/gogama/httpx@v1.1.5/timeout">timeout</a>.<a href="/github.com/gogama/httpx@v1.1.5/timeout#Policy">Policy</a>
<span id="Client.RetryPolicy" data-kind="field"> <span class="comment">// RetryPolicy decides when to retry failed attempts and how long</span>
</span> <span class="comment">// to sleep after a failed attempt before retrying.</span>
 <span class="comment">//</span>
 <span class="comment">// If RetryPolicy is nil, retry.DefaultPolicy is used.</span>
 RetryPolicy <a href="/github.com/gogama/httpx@v1.1.5/retry">retry</a>.<a href="/github.com/gogama/httpx@v1.1.5/retry#Policy">Policy</a>
<span id="Client.RacingPolicy" data-kind="field"> <span class="comment">// RacingPolicy specifies how to race concurrent requests if this</span>
</span> <span class="comment">// advanced feature is desired.</span>
 <span class="comment">//</span>
