 <span class="comment">// concurrent requests, is used.</span>
 RacingPolicy <a href="/github.com/gogama/httpx@v1.1.5/racing">racing</a>.<a href="/github.com/gogama/httpx@v1.1.5/racing#Policy">Policy</a>
