<span id="IdleCloser.CloseIdleConnections" data-kind="method"> CloseIdleConnections()
</span>}</pre>
 </div>
 <p>IdleCloser is the interface that wraps the basic CloseIdleConnections
method.
</p><p>If the underlying implementation supports it, CloseIdleConnections
